{"3713240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Drone War", "steam_appid": 3713240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4803220], "detailed_description": "<h1>Free Demo Available NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard, pilot! Demo weighs ~2.2 GB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New updates and gameplay video on our TikTok: @lastdronewar or (link on the right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/d19fb058a3c2ba12aac892121e17237f.poster.avif?t=1781597943\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/d19fb058a3c2ba12aac892121e17237f.webm?t=1781597943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/d19fb058a3c2ba12aac892121e17237f.mp4?t=1781597943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a frontline pilot in a modern battlefield. Coordinate airstrikes with precision, send FPV drones or decimate enemy armor with a jet cannon. Your choices <strong>will</strong> change the outcome of the battle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLIGHT THAT FEELS ALIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re threading an FPV drone through enemy EW or pushing a jet into a high-G cannon run, the physics-driven flight model gives every maneuver weight, speed, and purpose. It’s built for players who love airpower, precision flying, and battlefield-deciding strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/c06828a30bf10c770a4dd35660d26412.poster.avif?t=1781597943\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/c06828a30bf10c770a4dd35660d26412.webm?t=1781597943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/c06828a30bf10c770a4dd35660d26412.mp4?t=1781597943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHORT, INTENSE MISSIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fast replayability and focused, high-pressure gameplay. Play anytime you want, protect Komarovo in Last Drone War.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a frontline pilot in a modern battlefield. Coordinate airstrikes with precision, send FPV drones or decimate enemy armor with a jet cannon. Your choices <strong>will</strong> change the outcome of the battle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLIGHT THAT FEELS ALIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re threading an FPV drone through enemy EW or pushing a jet into a high-G cannon run, the physics-driven flight model gives every maneuver weight, speed, and purpose. It’s built for players who love airpower, precision flying, and battlefield-deciding strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/c06828a30bf10c770a4dd35660d26412.poster.avif?t=1781597943\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/c06828a30bf10c770a4dd35660d26412.webm?t=1781597943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/extras/c06828a30bf10c770a4dd35660d26412.mp4?t=1781597943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHORT, INTENSE MISSIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fast replayability and focused, high-pressure gameplay. Play anytime you want, protect Komarovo in Last Drone War.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You lose the war! Pilot FPV drones, helicopters, and fighter jets to unleash devastating firepower - and become a true ACE of modern warfare.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/d23192d0cf4299ed29515b17cfd7499e557cfbb8/header.jpg?t=1781597943", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/8fad2397839a4bd874dd3deb1c3ff444ab277cf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781597943", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713240/8fad2397839a4bd874dd3deb1c3ff444ab277cf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781597943", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 or AMD Radeon RX 580 (8 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K or AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1